msgid "Your lock screen"
msgstr "Je vergrendelscherm"

#: src/agent/qml/LockChoice.qml:209
msgid ""
"Your desktop leaves the lock screen to a program of your choice. Pick how "
"face unlock shows up there. You can change it later under Settings."
msgstr ""
"Je bureaublad laat het vergrendelscherm over aan een programma naar keuze. "
"Kies hoe face unlock daar verschijnt. Je kunt dit later onder Instellingen "
"wijzigen."

#: src/agent/qml/LockChoice.qml:232
msgid "face-unlock's lock screen"
msgstr "Vergrendelscherm van face-unlock"

#: src/agent/qml/LockChoice.qml:233
msgid ""
"The bubble at the top, the time and your wallpaper. Your shortcut and idle "
"lock then run face-unlock lock."
msgstr ""
"De bubbel bovenaan, de tijd en je achtergrond. Je sneltoets en vergrendelen "
"bij inactiviteit starten dan face-unlock lock."

